== Trivia ==
* The bullet pattern might be a reference to a power-up in the NES game ''Uncle Fester's Quest''.
* Ring worm (or [[wikipedia:Dermatophytosis|Dermatophytosis]]) is a fungal infection very common in children and teenagers. It involves scaly rings on the skin of the scalp, chest, arms, stomach and other places, and is not caused by any sort of worm despite its name.

